    "detailed_description": "EZ-Crosshair is a user-friendly application designed to enhance your gaming experience. It provides a customizable crosshair overlay, allowing players to tailor their crosshair to suit their preferences. With a simple and intuitive interface, EZ-Crosshair ensures a seamless and personalized gaming environment. Elevate your accuracy and gameplay with this essential tool.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Create, save, and share custom crosshairs.<br></li><li>Works in full screen mode.<br></li><li>Supports console controllers.<br></li><li>Download crosshairs from the community.<br></li><li>Share crosshairs with the community.<br></li><li>Use crosshairs from your friends.<br></li><li>Import images.<br></li><li>Create multiple layers.<br></li><li>Change shape, color, size, effects, position, and more.<br></li><li>Add animations to crosshairs.<br></li><li>Animate the crosshair whenever you want (when aiming, shooting, or any other action).<br></li><li>Assign a shortcut to enable/disable each crosshair.<br></li><li>Easy and intuitive UI.</li></ul>",
